{
  "title": "Hot Chocolate Manhattan",
  "description": "It's very cold. Have a warm, cozy cocktail.",
  "instructions": "In a saucepan, heat milk on stovetop, medium-high. Do not let boil over.\n\nWhile milk is heating, combine chocolate, whiskey, vermouth, and bitters in a mug or heat-safe glass.\n\nWhen milk is fully heated, and starting to rise/expand, pour hot milk into the mug/glass.\n\nStir to mix in chocolate and liquor.\n\n(Optional) Garnish with whip cream and grated nutmeg.",
